$ docker buildx imagetools inspect localhost:5000/shop-worker:1.0
ERROR: failed to do request: Head "https://localhost:5000/v2/shop-worker/manifests/1.0": tls: failed to verify certificate: x509: certificate signed by unknown authority

# imagetools tourne côté CLIENT (pas dans BuildKit) : il lui faut la CA, et le builder shop pour la règle « https sur localhost »
$ SSL_CERT_FILE=registry/trust/ca.crt docker buildx imagetools inspect --builder shop localhost:5000/shop-worker:1.0
