# Les binaires natifs de chaque variante sont-ils pour la bonne architecture ? (e_machine ELF : 0x3e = x86-64, 0xb7 = AArch64)
linux/amd64 : _psycopg.cpython-312-x86_64-linux-gnu.so e_machine=0x3e  |  python3.12 e_machine=0x3e  |  config: {"architecture":"amd64","os":"linux","user":"10001:10001"}
linux/arm64 : _psycopg.cpython-312-aarch64-linux-gnu.so e_machine=0xb7  |  python3.12 e_machine=0xb7  |  config: {"architecture":"arm64","os":"linux","user":"10001:10001"}
